	(text_box "Use 10 V or higher X5R/X7R ceramic capacitors, placed close to the chip. \nTI recommends 1 µF input bypassing and demonstrates a 100 µF output; \nthe final output capacitance depends on load current and allowable switching dip. \nAccount for ceramic capacitance loss at 5 V. ti.com\n"
